 release notes","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/bundle/store-release-notes/page/release-notes/store/sn-store-release-notes.html","line":32},{"title":"Detailed information on products discovered by ITOM Visibility","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/itom-visibility/r_SupportedApplications.md","line":34},{"title":"Fortinet Document Library","target":"https://docs.fortinet.com/","line":55},{"title":"Disable SNMP-based Fortinet firewall discovery","target":"disable-snmp-fortinet-fw-discovery","line":71},{"title":"Disable SNMP-based Fortinet firewall discovery","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery-and-service-mapping-patterns/disable-snmp-fortinet-fw-discovery.md","line":73},{"title":"Create an alias for the API key credential for Fortinet firewall REST-based discovery","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery-and-service-mapping-patterns/create-alias-api-key-cred-fortinet.md","line":77},{"title":"serverless discovery","target":"serverless-discovery","line":79},{"title":"Create a serverless schedule for Fortinet firewall REST-based discovery","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery-and-service-mapping-patterns/create-serverless-schedule-fortinet.md","line":81},{"title":"Discovery","target":"r-discovery","line":206},{"title":"Service Mapping","target":"c_ServiceMappingOverview","line":207},{"title":"Disable SNMP-based Fortinet firewall discovery","target":"disable-snmp-fortinet-fw-discovery","line":208},{"title":"Serverless Discovery","target":"serverless-discovery","line":209}],"metadata":{"title":"Fortinet firewall and FortiGate VDOM REST-based discovery","description":"The Discovery and Service Mapping Patterns application uses the 